_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Missing upper bound on `zoomBy`.**

The function clamps the minimum to `0.01` but allows the value to exceed `ZOOM_LEVELS.at(-1)` (400%). This is inconsistent with `zoomIn`/`zoomOut` which are bounded by `ZOOM_LEVELS`, and allows users to zoom past 400% by repeatedly pressing ArrowUp.


<details>
<summary>🔧 Proposed fix to add upper bound</summary>

```diff
  const zoomBy = useCallback(
    (delta: number) => {
-      set(Math.max(0.01, value + delta));
+      const min = ZOOM_LEVELS[0];
+      const max = ZOOM_LEVELS[ZOOM_LEVELS.length - 1];
+      set(Math.max(min, Math.min(max, value + delta)));
    },
    [set, value]
  );
```
</details>

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
