update the zoomBy callback to clamp the new value between 0.01 and the max zoom
level (use ZOOM_LEVELS.at(-1) or the equivalent MAX_ZOOM) before calling set, so
it matches the bounds enforced by zoomIn/zoomOut (refer to the zoomBy function,
set, value, and ZOOM_LEVELS symbols).
```

